ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED"}],"），根因是路径解析、WebView2 运行时与 dev-server fallback 三者叠加的脆弱链路。最终改用 ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Electron 封装现有 Web 前端"}],"，一次拿到多屏投屏、本地文件、真持久化与自动更新全套桌面能力。"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"主进程权威态（Single Source of Truth）"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["系统有主控制窗与两个投屏窗（竞价页 / 欢迎页），它们是独立的渲染进程。若让控制台兼任持久化与广播源头，多窗口写入必然产生冲突。因此主进程持有 ",["$","code",null,{"children":"canonicalState"}]," / ",["$","code",null,{"children":"canonicalConfig"}]," 作为唯一权威态："]}],"\n",["$","pre",null,{"className":"language-text","children":["$","code",null,{"className":"language-text","children":"控制台 push-state\n  → db.persist(state)                  # SQL 落盘\n  → canonicalState = state             # 更新权威态\n  → broadcastToDisplays('state-sync')  # 广播所有投屏窗\n"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["投屏窗只读不回写：挂载时 ","$L7"," 回拉最新态，随后订阅 ","$L8"," 实时刷新。崩溃重启后可立即回拉，状态不丢。"]}],"\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10"]}],["$L11"],"$L12"]}],{},null,false,null]},null,false,"$@13"]},null,false,"$@13"]},null,false,null],"$L14",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$15",["$L16","$L17"]],"S":true,"h":null,"s":"$undefined","l":"$undefined","p":"$undefined","d":"$undefined","b":"pEVCHcpdQDD1gkrVW2f9J"}
